WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.407
Go one point twenty-three is out.

00:00:02.407 --> 00:00:04.450
Range loops can now run over

00:00:04.450 --> 00:00:08.534
iterator functions, so you can write
your own sequences.

00:00:08.534 --> 00:00:14.224
Collecting a map's keys into a sorted
slice takes one line: slices dot Sorted,

00:00:14.224 --> 00:00:15.245
maps dot Keys.

00:00:15.245 --> 00:00:20.496
There are three new standard library
packages: iter, structs and unique.

00:00:20.496 --> 00:00:22.830
Timers and tickers got a rework.

00:00:22.830 --> 00:00:27.500
The go command has new conveniences,
and Go telemetry is opt-in.
